## Testing Suite

### Cypress E2E Tests
```bash
# Run all tests
npm run cypress:run

# Run specific test file
npm run cypress:run -- --spec "cypress/e2e/admin/settings-page.cy.js"

# Open Cypress UI
npm run cypress:open
```

### Build & Archive
```bash
# Build assets
npm run build

# Create distribution archive
npm run archive

# Build blocks only
npm run build:blocks
```

